{"id":"682d590f722cc4d0","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-finite-intersection.md","title":"Finite Intersection Property","display":"df-finite-intersection — Finite Intersection Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-finite-intersection","aliases":["58-df-finite-intersection"],"display":"df-finite-intersection — Finite Intersection Property","depends_on":["[[58-df-filter]]","[[58-df-set]]","[[58-df-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-finite-intersection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-finite-intersection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-intersection — Finite Intersection Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (set and family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FIP}_X(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{FIP}_X(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> (finite-intersection predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}intersection} \\vdash \\mathrm{FIP}_X(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow X\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal G)\\land\\mathcal G\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal G\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}intersection} \\vdash \\mathrm{FIP}_X(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow X\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal G)\\land\\mathcal G\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal G\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A family on a nonempty base has FIP if every nonempty finite subfamily has nonempty intersection; the explicit base guard also accounts for the empty subfamily, whose relative intersection is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Families with FIP can be extended to ultrafilters.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FIP}_X(\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}intersection} \\vdash \\mathrm{FIP}_X(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow X\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal G)\\land\\mathcal G\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal G\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1124,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-358","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-intersection]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-527","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-finite-intersection.md|58-df-finite-intersection]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["1331244a5201bb99","65d9a1e690c32aad","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}